            "review_title": "Review at Anh Nam Food & Coffee",
            "review_text": "fitnfifty\nBrisbane, Australia149 contributions\n0\nGreat Find\nOct 2022 • Couples\nWe have been looking for old fashioned Vietnamese food not seafood for past 2 days while staying near beach side. While we understand covid didnt help it seems as if in this part of Danang the little Vietnamese cafes only open for breakfast now 😒 but after much looking we found this great family run cafe . They cook delicious food like Com Ga, Bun cha with crab cake we had tonight and tasty yoghurt smoothies. The pricing here is really good . They are open from 6am to 2pm then 6pm to 9pm go pay them a visit you will not be disappointed oh they have e beer too\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2022\nANH NAM\nWe are really appreciate your kindly review. It will be a big motivation for our growing. Many thanks for choosing us and hope both of you have a good health!\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
